{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o110a","title":"开平虏渠与泉州渠","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o110a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操将征乌丸，开平虏渠与泉州渠以通海。","evidence":["wudi-e-o110a-q"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-eaa1d1400a153e92dd3b","label":"正文","text":"董昭建议凿平虏泉州二渠通运","evidence":["chengguo-q-2f9f2b79b0a33d84cd09"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"开渠","evidence":["wudi-e-o110a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0122","role":"建凿二渠","evidence":["chengguo-q-2f9f2b79b0a33d84cd09"]}],"place":{"text":"呼沲、泒水、泃河口、潞河","evidence":["wudi-e-o110a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十一年，北征筹备时","year":206,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o110a-q","wudi-q-o107","wudi-q-b-6509a80488ce395ecab9"],"chronology":"wudi-y206","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o107","basis":"建安十一年，北征筹备时","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,602,"O110a"],"order":247}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0122","name":"董昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-2f9f2b79b0a33d84cd09","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-305aeb3708c5a2bebd43","layer":"original","quote":"后袁尚依乌丸蹋顿，太祖将征之。患军粮难致，凿平虏、泉州二渠入海通运：昭所建也，","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39},{"id":"wudi-e-o110a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1f046c91bbea49cb43cb","layer":"original","quote":"公将征之，凿渠，自呼沲入泒水〖11〗，﹝二﹞名“平虏渠”〖12〗。又从泃河口〖13〗，﹝三﹞凿入潞河，名“泉州渠”〖14〗，以通海。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":601,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":66},{"id":"wudi-q-b-6509a80488ce395ecab9","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6509a80488ce395ecab9","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十一年：建安十一年（公元 206）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":603,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-60fd0962dbcc47eb5807","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o107","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-25deb42237a5de280ce3","layer":"original","quote":"十一年春正月〖1〗，公征幹。幹闻之，乃留其别将守城，走入匈奴，求救于单于〖2〗。单于不受。公围壶关三月，拔之。幹遂走荆州〖3〗，上洛都尉王琰捕斩之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":598,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":74}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
